A :BEGININLINECODE block with no name, so GetInlineCode() has nothing to
read it by: inline_code_naming (error), missing-name path, ranged on the
keyword (diag.inline_code_naming first Flags fence).
-- input.ssl --
:BEGININLINECODE;
:DECLARE sGreeting;
sGreeting := "hello";
:ENDINLINECODE;
-- format --
:BEGININLINECODE;
	:DECLARE sGreeting;
	sGreeting := "hello";
:ENDINLINECODE;
-- diagnostics --
1:1-1:17 error inline_code_naming: ':BEGININLINECODE' requires a name (identifier or quoted string)
